Digital\ Yuan
]

[
Digital\ Euro
]

[
Digital\ Yen
]

[
Digital\ Pound
]

[
Digital\ Real
]

and hundreds of other digital currencies.

The question then becomes:

Where does the digital dollar fit?

From a mathematical-futurological standpoint, the answer cannot be left entirely to historical momentum.

The dollar’s future network effect may depend partly on whether it participates in the architecture of digital settlement.

